{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is a story about death, love, wealth, and saving the world.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The DEMO includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About an hour long prologue plot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12000 words, dozens of CG images</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>story\uff1a</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a hero who saved the world, but you were killed by your own bride. Who among the six girls around you would be the mastermind behind the scenes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against mysterious monsters from the unknown, future, and abyss, become a billionaire from scratch, and search for the truth behind events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And this all starts with a dream of yours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Introduction:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u84dd\u6d77\u516d\u91cd\u594f\u00a0is a suspenseful love AVG produced by Ku Xiaoshui. The game does not use AI art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u84dd\u6d77\u516d\u91cd\u594f is a visual novel with a storyline experience as its core. In this game, players will play as a man with two completely different fates, switching between the roles of a decadent unemployed young man and a hero who saves the world. They embark on a romantic and perilous adventure with six sweet and lovely women.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After making different choices, the game will have a completely different ending.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4039920?t=1758849343","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4039920?t=1758849343","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039920/88c94ef58ba9b52d97b97c00702adba899786c7b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758849343","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039920/88c94ef58ba9b52d97b97c00702adba899786c7b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758849343","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"This game contains some revealing clothing and is not suitable for all age groups: common adult content.\r\nAll characters in the game are adults"},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is a story about death, love, wealth, and saving the world.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The DEMO includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About an hour long prologue plot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12000 words, dozens of CG images</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>story\uff1a</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a hero who saved the world, but you were killed by your own bride. Who among the six girls around you would be the mastermind behind the scenes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against mysterious monsters from the unknown, future, and abyss, become a billionaire from scratch, and search for the truth behind events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And this all starts with a dream of yours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Introduction:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u84dd\u6d77\u516d\u91cd\u594f\u00a0is a suspenseful love AVG produced by Ku Xiaoshui. The game does not use AI art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u84dd\u6d77\u516d\u91cd\u594f is a visual novel with a storyline experience as its core. In this game, players will play as a man with two completely different fates, switching between the roles of a decadent unemployed young man and a hero who saves the world. They embark on a romantic and perilous adventure with six sweet and lovely women.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After making different choices, the game will have a completely different ending.</p>","developers":["\u82e6\u5c0f\u6c34"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3921960","name":"BlueSea:sixgirls"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://